From: Abdul Alim <abdul_alim1997@live.co.uk<mailto:abdul_alim1997@live.co.uk>>
Sent: 05 February 2026 11:44
To: ManchesterET <manchesterET@Justice.gov.uk<mailto:manchesterET@Justice.gov.uk>>; Stephanie Paton <stephanie.paton@pinsentmasons.com<mailto:stephanie.paton@pinsentmasons.com>>
Subject: 2406202/2023 Abdul Alim v Royal and Sun Alliance Insurance Limited



Good morning,



Can I ask for confirmation that the documents I have submitted will be placed on the file and ask if Judge Ross is close to her decision on the strike out by the defendant.



The strike out cannot be enforced on the multiple grounds I have laid out and, in my opinion, should have been swiftly rejected.



Kind regards,

Abdul Alim

